[gd_scene format=3]

; The Sump, under the Chantry's floor (the sequel world's Hatch, worlds/sequel/network.md): where the chapel's meltwater drained,
; a tall dry shaft of a room. The hatch in its roof is the way back up to the Chantry, climbed by a ladder of three ledges (no ability);
; coming down is a drop. A dead end.

